WEBVTT

00:04:58.756 --> 00:05:00.036
(Laughter)

00:05:01.156 --> 00:05:04.196
And it's cumulative,
so eventually you just can't eat.

00:05:04.236 --> 00:05:05.716
(Laughter)

00:05:06.196 --> 00:05:08.476
Random tattoo generator,

00:05:08.516 --> 00:05:10.676
a random Spotify playlist,

00:05:10.716 --> 00:05:12.236
random podcast,

00:05:12.236 --> 00:05:15.756
a printer that prints out
random suggestions of things to do.

00:05:15.796 --> 00:05:17.876
(Laughter)

00:05:17.916 --> 00:05:19.836
A random Facebook event generator.

00:05:19.836 --> 00:05:21.356
And the way that this one works

00:05:21.356 --> 00:05:24.156
is that in a city like Vienna
on a given day,

00:05:24.196 --> 00:05:26.116
there are hundreds of Facebook events --

00:05:26.116 --> 00:05:28.196
public Facebook events --
that are going on.

00:05:28.196 --> 00:05:30.196
So it would choose one at random and say,